# What stays out of the public repository.
# docs/PUBLIC-COPY.md gives each folder and file of the public copy, the sizes and the reasons.
# docs/PUBLISHING-CHECK.md gives the terms of the sources.

# Raw downloads: approximately 12 GB, and the terms of the COMNAP file forbid republishing it.
# Two lines: in a copy of the project, data/raw can be a link (symlink). Git does not match a
# link with "data/raw/", and the link holds a computer path with a user name.
data/raw
data/raw/

# Python environment, caches and build leftovers
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/

# Unfinished downloads and half-written files (the scripts write "<name>.part" first)
*.part
*.part.*
*.tmp

# Result files of data/derived: approximately 1.2 GB on 15 November 2026. Three files are larger
# than GitHub's limit of 100 MiB (cells_scored.json, mars_cells.json, grazing_cells.json).
# Only two groups go in (docs/PUBLIC-COPY.md, section 4):
#   the result files that the documents link to or name for a figure, and
#   the files of earlier versions that no script can make again (docs/REPRODUCE.md, section 3).
# The scripts make the other files again (docs/REPRODUCE.md, sections 4 to 8).
data/derived/*
!data/derived/RESULTS-FINAL.md
!data/derived/RESULTS.md
!data/derived/RESULTS-all-regions.md
!data/derived/MARS-RESULTS.md
!data/derived/AI-NOTE.txt
!data/derived/checks.json
!data/derived/factor_matrix.json
!data/derived/latitude_profile.json
!data/derived/mars_sites.json
!data/derived/moon_cards.json
!data/derived/moon_targets.json
!data/derived/planet_factors.json
!data/derived/validation.json
!data/derived/validation_extras.json
!data/derived/winter_leads.json
!data/derived/mars_sites_base.json
!data/derived/light_cells_v1.json
!data/derived/cells_scored_v1.json
!data/derived/ranking_v1.txt
!data/derived/validation_v1.json
!data/derived/cells_scored_v2.json
!data/derived/validation_v2.json
!data/derived/ranking_v2.txt
!data/derived/RESULTS_v2.md
!data/derived/count_check_v3.json

# Working notes and task sheets: private (docs/PUBLIC-COPY.md, section 2).
# Nine of these files hold a computer path with a user name.
research_notes/
reports/
docs/superpowers/
handoff/

# Working folders of the main project. This copy does not have them; never publish them.
variants/
candidates/
test-data/

# Operating system and editor files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# Local settings, secrets and logs
.env
.env.*
*.log
.claude/
